  "notes": "3 security/perf improvements implemented and tested:\n\n1. file-lock.ts: Path traversal sanitization — '..' segments replaced with '_' in lockFilePathFor() to prevent lock files being written outside .locks/ directory. 4 new tests.\n\n2. deck-file.ts: createDeckTemplate() now writes with mode 0o600 (owner read/write only) instead of default umask. 1 new test.\n\n3. credential-encryption.ts: getMasterKey() now caches results with 5-minute TTL. Cache is skipped for env-var based keys (which can change at runtime). invalidateMasterKeyCache() exported for testing and key rotation. 4 new tests.\n\nAll 114 tests in scope files PASS. tsc --noEmit clean. Full core/ suite: 121/123 pass (2 failures are pre-existing ölü dosya import errors from deleted orchestra modules, not related to this task).",
